[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":33,"col":9},"end":{"line":33,"col":10}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: an event of this other module's markup makes its\nmessage when it fires, and `browser-inline` puts that message under the\n`Html.map`s around the call, each of which must be a constructor of one field\n(`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.7; §5, class 4). The program is valid: it\nbuilds with `--platform=browser-tea`."}]
